# Hash-locked closure that .github/workflows/ci.yml installs into the separate
# cffconvert virtualenv (Python 3.12), with --require-hashes.
# The top-level pin stays in requirements-citation.txt (README Quickstart;
# Dependabot "/" entry). Regenerate citation.txt whenever
# requirements-citation.txt changes (tests/test_ci_requirements_lock.py fails
# on drift):
#   uv pip compile --universal --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 \
#     requirements/ci/citation.in -o requirements/ci/citation.txt
-r ../../requirements-citation.txt
